<title>USA: American Industrial hires financial adviser.</title>
<headline>American Industrial hires financial adviser.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Industrial Properties REIT Wednesday said it had engaged Prudential Securities Inc as its exclusive financial adviser for the purpose of providing the Trust with financial advisory services.</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc is a wholly owned subsidiary of The Prudential Insurance Company of America.</p>
